<title>JAPAN: JAPAN TO MAKE UP TO $7 BLN LOANS TO THAILAND-PAPER.</title>
<headline>JAPAN TO MAKE UP TO $7 BLN LOANS TO THAILAND-PAPER.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan has decided to contribute a maximum $7 billion in lending through the Export-Import Bank of Japan to a $20 billion international support package for Thailand, the Nihon Keizai Shimbun reported on Thursday.</p>
</text>
